course: dictionary
lesson: 3052
title: Easy, and what it can mean
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Easy has more than one meaning, so the context tells you which one fits. «Scanning your shopping is easy» means it is not difficult to do. «Take it easy after your swim» means relax and don't work too hard. Ask yourself: is this about difficulty, comfort, or how to treat someone?
explain: Easy can also describe how something feels. «An easy chair» is a comfortable, relaxed chair. Easy changes its form too: easier, easiest, and easily. «Albino animals burn easily in sun» means they burn without much effort.
explain: A word that sounds simple can hide a trap. Easy tricks, like a free prize online that asks for your bank details, are often scams. If something looks too easy, slow down and check before you believe it.
fact: Easy means not difficult, simple to do or understand.
fact: Easy can also mean comfortable and relaxed, as in «an easy chair».
fact: «Take it easy» means relax and don't work too hard.
fact: «Go easy on» means be gentle with someone or something.
fact: «Easier said than done» means something sounds simple but is hard in real life.
exercise: What does easy mean in «an easy chair»? | Old and broken | Very cheap | Simple to build | *Comfortable and relaxed
exercise: What does «take it easy» mean? | Take the easy road home | Hurry up and finish | *Relax and don't work too hard | Count slowly to ten
exercise: «Go easy on the new puppy.» What does this mean? | *Be gentle with it | Feed it lots of treats | Shout at it when it barks | Leave it alone for hours
test: Which word from «Albino animals often see poorly, burn easily in sun and are easier for predators to spot» is an adverb form of easy? | easier | predators | poorly | *easily
test: Why might a free prize online that is easy to win be a warning sign? | Prizes are never online | Free prizes are always real | Easy means it is definitely true | *Easy tricks like this are often scams
exam: In «Clothes, colours and special marks are easy details to notice about a person», what does easy mean? | Comfortable and relaxed | Very old | Gentle and kind | *Simple to notice, not hard
